title: >-
  Concussion Hub: an evidence-based clinical reference on
  concussion and mild traumatic brain injury
message: If you use this resource, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  # TODO: replace with your full name and, if you have one, your ORCID
  - given-names: Marcus
    family-names: ""
    email: marcusfco@gmail.com
repository-code: 'https://github.com/<your-username>/concussion-hub'
url: 'https://<your-username>.github.io/concussion-hub/'
abstract: >-
  An interactive clinical reference covering the mechanism, assessment,
  management, persisting symptoms and long-term risk of concussion and
  mild traumatic brain injury. Built on the Amsterdam 2023 international
  consensus statement and 90 peer-reviewed sources, with interactive
  clinical calculators and separate clinician, athlete and patient views.
keywords:
  - concussion
  - mild traumatic brain injury
  - sport-related concussion
  - return to sport
  - vestibular rehabilitation
  - clinical decision support
